---
import PageShell from '../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Disclaimer | Med Spa Marketing Guide';
const seoDesc =
	'Read limitations: no warranties, no treatment outcomes promised, no Google ranking pledges—only educational narratives.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>Disclaimer</h1>
	<p>
		Information on Med Spa Marketing Guide is provided for educational marketing purposes only. Nothing here
		constitutes medical advice, legal advice, or a clinician–patient relationship. Always defer treatment decisions,
		diagnoses, and protocols to appropriately licensed providers.
	</p>
	<h2>No guaranteed marketing outcomes</h2>
	<p>
		We explicitly disclaim guarantees about search rankings, impression volume, lead counts, ROI, Maps placement, or ad
		performance. Competitive density, geography, adherence, budgets, staffing, regulatory constraints, platform
		changes, and product–market fit all influence outcomes unpredictably.
	</p>
	<h2>Citations & liabilities</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Outbound links appear for citation convenience—we do not control third-party content.</li>
		<li>You assume responsibility for HIPAA, FTC, ASA, OSHA, payer, licensing, vendor, AI, accessibility, ADA, CPRA/CDPA nuances.</li>
		<li>Swap placeholder contact emails before interpreting any reach-out instructions as authoritative.</li>
	</ul>
</PageShell>
